## 🟡 High Priority Features

### 7. **Admin Panel & Role Management**
**Priority:** High  
**Complexity:** Medium  
**Time Estimate:** 3-4 days

**What to do:**
- Create admin-only endpoints
- Implement user management (list, edit, delete users)
- Add role assignment functionality
- Create property approval workflow
- Implement user statistics dashboard

**Endpoints:**
```java
GET /admin/users - List all users
PUT /admin/users/{id}/role - Update user role
DELETE /admin/users/{id} - Delete user
GET /admin/properties/pending - Pending approvals
PUT /admin/properties/{id}/approve - Approve property
```

---

